# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. A coordinated restore converges only if
# every cluster cuts over to the same point: the source-restore contract's remedy.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceCoordinatedRestoreCutsOneCluster
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the coordinated restore cuts the source over but not its peer, so the clusters stay apart
PERTURBS: CoordinatedRestore

--- FIND
          /\ reg' = [x \in Clusters |-> c]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: only the source cuts over.
          /\ reg' = [reg EXCEPT ![s] = c]
--- END
